4RmsyWVoydDRmdG9kY1Y0SmItMllLS3B6eGhEcnNFM09LSno1cVhhUFgwczRPTGVtcUlVMmw3MWVUMEg1OWxqbWRQTkpnOC1jTmlIR2lMUWpSSlBOSDZFYjl5aE5xRGNvMWhGLWI2U290bHp6dW1DX1FZazk4YnNjZFF4U1BKUV8wUmttR1VadldTMFRTMGd5YXhBZTNaZThxdDJiZUhHUUFuZFJtemlOb0pXX2ln?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"紐蒙特公司因金價上漲和卡迪亞復甦而超出季度利潤預期"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1164727/000116472726000010/nem-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Newmont Corporation was incorporated in 1921 and is primarily a gold producer with significant operations and/or assets in the United States, Papua New Guinea, Australia, Ghana, Suriname, Argentina, Dominican Republic, Chile, Peru, Ecuador, Mexico, and Canada. At December 31, 2025, Newmont had attributable proven and probable gold reserves of 118.2 million ounces, attributable measured and indicated gold resources of 88.1 million ounces, attributable inferred gold resources of 60.6 million ounces, and an aggregate land position of approximately 19,200 square miles (49,800 square kilometers). Newmont is also engaged in the production of copper, silver, lead, and zinc. As the world's leading gold company, Newmont remains committed to creating value and improving lives through sustainable and responsible mining.","zh":"紐蒙特公司成立於 1921 年，主要是一家黃金生產商，在美國、巴布亞紐幾內亞、澳洲、加納、蘇利南、阿根廷、多明尼加共和國、智利、秘魯、厄瓜多、墨西哥和加拿大擁有大量業務和/或資產。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，紐蒙特公司擁有探明和概算黃金儲量 1.182 億盎司，測得和指示黃金資源量為 8,810 萬盎司，推斷黃金資源量為 6,060 萬盎司，土地總面積約為 19,200 平方英里（49,800 平方公里）。紐蒙特也從事銅、銀、鉛和鋅的生產。作為世界領先的黃金公司，紐蒙特始終致力於透過永續和負責任的採礦創造價值並改善生活。"},{"en":"Newmont's corporate headquarters are in Denver, Colorado, U.S. In this report, \"Newmont,\" the \"Company,\" \"our,\" and \"we\" refer to Newmont Corporation together with our affiliates and subsidiaries, unless the context otherwise requires.","zh":"紐蒙特公司總部位於美國科羅拉多州丹佛市。在本報告中，除非上下文另有要求，「紐蒙特」、「本公司」、「我們的」和「我們」均指紐蒙特公司以及我們的附屬公司和子公司。"},{"en":"Based on a comprehensive review of the Company's portfolio of assets following the acquisition of Newcrest Mining Limited (\"Newcrest\"), the Company's Board of Directors approved a portfolio optimization program to divest six non-core assets and a development project in February 2024. The non-core assets to be divested included Telfer, CC&V, Musselwhite, l onore, Porcupine, Akyem, and the Coffee development project in Canada. The Company presented these assets as held for sale in the first quarter of 2024 and recorded the assets at the lower of their carrying value or fair value, less costs to sell.","zh":"基於對收購Newcrest Mining Limited（「Newcrest」）後公司資產組合的全面審查，公司董事會於2024年2月批准了資產組合優化方案，剝離六項非核心資產和一個開發案。擬剝離的非核心資產包括Telfer、CC&V、Musselwhite、lonore、Porcupine、Akyem以及加拿大的Coffee開發案。本公司於2024年第一季將這些資產列為持有待售，並以帳面價值或公允價值減去出售成本中的較低者記錄資產。"}],"markets":[{"en":"References in this report to \"attributable\" means that portion of gold, copper, silver, lead, or zinc produced, sold or included in proven and probable reserves and measured, indicated, and inferred resources based on our proportionate ownership, unless otherwise noted.","zh":"除非另有說明，本報告中提及的「可歸屬」是指根據我們的比例所有權生產、銷售或包含在探明和概算儲量以及測量、指示和推斷資源中的金、銅、銀、鉛或鋅的部分。"},{"en":"General. The details of our consolidated and attributable gold production from continuing operations are set forth below:","zh":"一般的。我們持續經營業務的綜合及歸屬黃金產量詳情如下："}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The top 10 producers of gold comprise approximately 25% of total worldwide mined gold production. We currently rank as the top gold producer with approximately 5% of estimated total worldwide mined gold production. Our competitive position is based on the size and grade of our ore bodies anchored in favorable mining jurisdictions and our ability to manage costs compared with other producers. We have a diverse portfolio of mining operations with varying ore grades and cost structures. Our costs are driven by the location, grade and nature of our ore bodies, and the level of input costs, including energy, labor, and equipment. The metals markets are cyclical, and our ability to maintain our competitive position over the long term is based on our ability to acquire and develop quality deposits, hire and retain a skilled workforce, and manage our costs.","zh":"前 10 名的黃金生產商約佔全球礦產黃金總產量的 25%。目前，我們是最大的黃金生產商，約佔全球礦產黃金產量的 5%。我們的競爭地位是基於我們位於有利採礦管轄區的礦體的規模和品位，以及與其他生產商相比我們管理成本的能力。我們擁有多元化的採礦業務組合，具有不同的礦石品位和成本結構。我們的成本由礦體的位置、品位和性質以及投入成本水準（包括能源、勞動力和設備）決定。金屬市場是週期性的，我們長期保持競爭地位的能力取決於我們獲取和開發優質礦藏、僱用和留住熟練勞動力以及管理成本的能力。"},{"en":"Other than operating licenses for our mining and processing facilities, there are no third-party patents, operating licenses, or franchises material to our business. In many countries, however, we conduct our mining and exploration activities pursuant to land-related licenses which include leases, concessions, claims, or prospecting licenses granted by the host government. These countries include, among others, the United States, Papua New Guinea, Australia, Ghana, Suriname, Argentina, Dominican Republic, Chile, Peru, Ecuador, Mexico, and Canada. Refer to Item 2, Properties, below for further information on land-related licenses and concessions by property. The concessions and contracts are subject to the political risks associated with the host country. Refer to Item 1A, Risk Factors, below for further information.","zh":"除了我們的採礦和加工設施的營運許可證外，我們的業務沒有任何第三方專利、營運許可證或特許經營權。然而，在許多國家，我們根據與土地相關的許可證進行採礦和勘探活動，其中包括東道國政府授予的租賃、特許權、索賠或勘探許可證。這些國家包括美國、巴布亞紐幾內亞、澳洲、迦納、蘇利南、阿根廷、多明尼加共和國、智利、秘魯、厄瓜多、墨西哥和加拿大。有關土地相關許可證和按財產特許權的更多資訊，請參閱下文第 2 項「財產」。特許權和合約受到與東道國相關的政治風險的影響。請參閱下文第 1A 項「風險因素」以了解更多資訊。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2024-12-31","items":[{"name":"Nevada Gold Mines","val":2485000000,"zh":"內華達金礦"},{"name":"Penasquito","val":2322000000,"zh":"佩納斯基托"},{"name":"Ahafo South","val":1923000000,"zh":"阿哈福南"},{"name":"Cadia","val":1861000000,"zh":"卡迪亞"},{"name":"Boddington","val":1746000000,"zh":"博丁頓"},{"name":"Lihir","val":1473000000,"zh":"利希爾"},{"name":"Tanami","val":988000000,"zh":"田波"},{"name":"Yanacocha","val":841000000,"zh":"亞納科查"},{"name":"Porcupine","val":673000000,"zh":"豪豬"},{"name":"Merian Gold Project","val":660000000,"zh":"梅里安金礦項目"}],"total":18682000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Gold Dore","val":14330000000,"zh":"金多爾"},{"name":"Sales From Concentrate & Other Production","val":8339000000,"zh":"精礦及其他產品的銷售"}],"total":22669000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"GB","val":13068000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"KR","val":3196000000,"zh":"韓國"},{"name":"JP","val":2002000000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"CN","val":1411000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":1379000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"AU","val":803000000,"zh":"非盟"},{"name":"MX","val":639000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"CH","val":89000000,"zh":"CH"},{"name":"PH","val":82000000,"zh":"PH值"}],"total":22669000000}},"peers":["AEM","B","KGC","FCX","AU"]}}